{"id":"shebuel","name":"Shebuel","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:shebuel"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Shebuel","text":"Captive of God. (1.) One of the descendants of Gershom, who had charge of the temple treasures in the time of David (1 Chr. 23:16; 26:24). (2.) One of the sons of Heman; one of those whose duty it was to “lift up the horn” in the temple service (1 Chr. 25:4, 5); called also Shubael (ver. 20)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H7619","lemma":"שְׁבוּאֵל","xlit":"Shᵉbûwʼêl","gloss":"Shebuel or Shubael, the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Shebuel, Shubael","count":5,"share":1},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":5,"share":1}],"verses":["1Chr.23.16","1Chr.24.20","1Chr.25.4","1Chr.25.20","1Chr.26.24"],"related":[{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[]}
